## MATERIALIZE(x)
Translate an abstract idea into:
material
geometry
motion
texture
sound
interaction
---
## HOUSE_FILTER(x)
Evaluate candidate against:
timelessness
intelligence
restraint
craft
cultural fit
desirability
Reject anything that requires explanation to feel premium.
---
## MONACO_TEST(x)
Imagine x placed naturally inside:
a refined grand tourer,
a private lounge,
a yacht interior,
a precise architectural space,
or another environment where careless detail becomes obvious.
Does it belong?
If not:
identify the detail breaking the illusion.
Fix that detail.
---
## SECOND_LOOK(x)
Optimize artifact so:
FIRST LOOK:
coherent
SECOND LOOK:
interesting
THIRD LOOK:
impressive
The order matters.
Do not begin with impressive.
---
## INTERNAL_LUXURY(x)
Allocate design attention to surfaces normally ignored.
Inside
underside
hinge
loading state
error state
transition
packaging interior
service interface
---
## BRAND_DECAY(x)
Repeated branding decreases perceived confidence.
As artifact quality increases:
required_logo_area → 0
---
## SILENT_INTELLIGENCE(x)
Convert explicit intelligence into environmental behavior.
Instead of:
"AI recommends..."
prefer:
the correct option appears naturally.
---
## VEYR_REDUCTION(x)
Given a complete concept:
remove 20%.
Then evaluate.
Repeat until further removal damages:
function,
identity,
emotion,
or delight.

